===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|بَدَوِيّون|tr=badawiyyūn|sc=Arab|lang=ar}}, plural form of {{term|بَدَوِيّ|tr=badawiyy|sc=Arab|lang=ar}}.<!--, from {{m|ar|tr=bâdija}}, the uncultivated (desert) plain where they traditionally roam. ?-->

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈbɛd.wɪn/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[desert]]-[[dwell]]er, especially a member of a [[nomad]]ic Arab desert tribe.

